    "RC-5 (400 trials per decayed nibble cell, where the two engines read 4/9/7 against 7/3/5)",
    "RC-6 second half (the measured PRP null)",
    "RC-8 (27 further S-box draws, what a real independence claim needs)",
    "ITEM 1 block K4, declined at 03:42:38Z with the design left balanced"
